          "start": 360
        },
        "quote": "(b) When any cut or excavation is performed on any street, it shall be unlawful, without a traffic disruption permit issued by the Development Services Director and approved by the Traffic Engineering Department, to do any of the following acts:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.080:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.080 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "c2cbecea-c362-5b3f-bb31-6410472a4dc1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 776,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.080:block:2",
          "start": 606
        },
        "quote": "(1) Leave any pavement material, stone and earth or any other material removed from street cuts, openings or excavations on the street before 8:30 a.m. or after 4:00 p.m.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.080:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.080 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "0a84542e-79a5-5f46-a2c4-ca2b9cc756af",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 934,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.080:block:3",
          "start": 777
        },
        "quote": "(2) Perform any work which will require the closing of any lane of moving traffic between the hours of 7:00 a.m. and 8:30 a.m. or from 4:00 p.m. to 6:00 p.m.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.080:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 12.45.080 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "46ee1e89-09ab-5af6-b564-687bb04b9f59",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
