          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.45.080:block:4",
          "start": 935
        },
        "quote": "(3) Do or perform any work or operation or place any material, equipment, barricades or other obstructions in such a manner as to require the closing at any time of more than one lane of moving traffic on any street. (Ord. 18916 § 6, 6-26-07. Code 1995 § 130-160.)",
